msgid "Network Controller"
msgstr "Network Controller"

msgid ""
"网络控制器是使用 C++ 和 FLTK 编写的原生 X11 应用，启动命令为 ``network-"
"controller``。支持中文，入口位于系统应用菜单；默认包含在 Xorg 镜像中。 普通用户选择 sudo 密码或 root "
"密码解锁受限工作进程，GUI 保持原用户身份。 root 账户直接进入。密码不保存在命令参数、环境变量、文件或日志中。"
msgstr ""
"Network Controller is a native X11 application written in C++ and FLTK, "
"launched with ``network-controller``. It supports Chinese, appears in the "
"system applications menu, and is included in Xorg images by default. Regular"
" users unlock a restricted worker using either their sudo password or the "
"root password, while the GUI retains the original user identity. Root enters"
" directly. Passwords are not stored in command arguments, environment "
"variables, files, or logs."

msgid "查看与诊断"
msgstr "Inspection and Diagnostics"

msgid ""
"左侧按实际接口查询结果列出网卡。“概览”显示 IPv4、掩码、网关、MAC、MTU、 "
"解析器。自动刷新只更新状态，不覆盖未保存的配置。若系统导出标准接口计数，则 同时显示收发总量、速率、包数及错误；当前内核尚未导出这些计数，界面明确提示 "
"并隐藏该组字段，不把缺失数据显示为零。网关和连接信息使用已有公开网络查询接口。"
msgstr ""
"The left pane lists network adapters returned by actual interface queries. "
"Overview displays IPv4, netmask, gateway, MAC, MTU, and resolver "
"information. Automatic refresh updates status only, without overwriting "
"unsaved configuration. If the system exports standard interface counters, "
"totals, rates, packet counts, and errors for transmission and reception are "
"also shown. The current kernel does not yet export these counters; the "
"interface explicitly says so and hides those fields instead of presenting "
"missing data as zero. Gateway and connection information use existing public"
" network query interfaces."

msgid ""
"“诊断工具”提供 Ping、DNS 查询、TCP 端口测试和 IPv4 子网计算。工具菜单提供 有效路由、TCP 连接、DHCP 租约、解析器、DHCP"
" 日志和诊断报告。诊断命令 异步执行，支持取消、超时与关闭清理；结果在“输出”中保留，可复制或导出。 TCP 连接建立不代表 TLS "
"校验或目标应用健康；DNS、端口与 Ping 的失败各自报告。"
msgstr ""
"Diagnostic Tools provides Ping, DNS lookup, TCP port testing, and IPv4 "
"subnet calculation. The Tools menu offers effective routes, TCP connections,"
" DHCP leases, resolver information, DHCP logs, and diagnostic reports. "
"Diagnostic commands run asynchronously with cancellation, timeouts, and "
"cleanup on close. Results remain in Output and can be copied or exported. "
"Establishing a TCP connection does not prove TLS validation or target "
"application health; DNS, port, and Ping failures are reported separately."

msgid "配置与迁移"
msgstr "Configuration and Migration"

msgid ""
"左侧选择实际枚举的以太网接口并分别编辑；切换网卡前会提示丢弃未保存的修改。 没有 IPv4 地址或处于禁用状态的网卡也会显示。支持自动 DHCP、静态 "
"IPv4 和禁用；静态模式可以不设置默认网关，DNS 必须明确选择 自定义或 Cloudflare。自定义 DNS 最多三个 IPv4 "
"地址，以空格分隔。"
msgstr ""
"Select an actually enumerated Ethernet interface in the left pane and edit "
"each separately. Switching adapters prompts you to discard unsaved changes. "
"Interfaces without IPv4 addresses or currently disabled are also listed. "
"Modes include automatic DHCP, static IPv4, and disabled. Static mode allows "
"no default gateway, but DNS must explicitly be custom or Cloudflare. Custom "
"DNS accepts at most three space-separated IPv4 addresses."

msgid ""
"eth0 继续使用 ``/etc/reliefos/network.conf``；其他接口使用 "
"``/etc/reliefos/network.d/<接口名>.conf``。未设置的接口默认使用 DHCP。 配置是版本化数据，不作为 shell "
"脚本执行。静态地址、前缀、网关和 DNS 在 GUI、 工作进程及启动链分别验证，接口名必须对应已枚举的 ``eth`` 加十进制编号。 "
"文件目录和配置必须由 root 所有，不能由组或其他用户写入，不能使用符号链接 替代配置文件或目录。保存检查外部变动，并通过临时文件、同步与 "
"rename 原子 替换；各接口各自保留 ``.bak`` 备份。“恢复上次配置”也检查当前快照，不能 绕过冲突检查。 "
"原先没有配置文件的状态可以恢复为缺省状态。"
msgstr ""
"eth0 continues to use ``/etc/reliefos/network.conf``; other interfaces use "
"``/etc/reliefos/network.d/<接口名>.conf``. Unconfigured interfaces default to "
"DHCP. Configuration is versioned data, not executable shell scripts. Static "
"addresses, prefixes, gateways, and DNS are validated independently in the "
"GUI, worker, and boot chain. Interface names must match enumerated ``eth`` "
"names followed by a decimal number. Configuration files and directories must"
" be root-owned, not group- or other-writable, and must not be replaced by "
"symbolic links. Saving checks external changes and atomically replaces files"
" using temporary files, sync, and rename; each interface retains its own "
"``.bak`` backup. Restore Previous Configuration also checks the current "
"snapshot and cannot bypass conflict checks. An originally absent "
"configuration file can be restored to its default, absent state."

msgid ""
"旧的 DNS-only ``network.conf`` 保持可读；旧 udhcpc DNS 策略在迁移前继续生效。 "
"第一次保存写入完整的新格式并备份旧文件，恢复旧备份后仍能通过原链路启动。 升级时保留本地 ``/etc`` 配置，不要求手动删除旧文件。 版本化 "
"profile 生效后，旧 DNS 写入 API 返回 ``EBUSY``，调用方应通过本程序或 编辑 profile "
"后重启网络服务调整策略；不会在解析器忽略旧文件时谎报设置成功。 未迁移的旧配置继续支持旧 API。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy DNS-only ``network.conf`` files remain readable, and the old udhcpc "
"DNS policy remains active until migration. The first save writes the full "
"new format and backs up the old file; restoring that backup still allows "
"boot through the original chain. Upgrades preserve local ``/etc`` "
"configuration without requiring manual removal of old files. Once a "
"versioned profile takes effect, the old DNS write API returns ``EBUSY``. "
"Callers should change policy through this application or edit the profile "
"and restart networking; the API does not falsely report success while the "
"resolver ignores the old file. Unmigrated legacy configuration continues to "
"support the old API."

msgid ""
"``reliefos-dhcp`` OpenRC 服务启动时从 ``/proc/net/dev`` 枚举全部以太网卡， "
"逐卡设置静态/禁用状态或启动各自的 ``supervise-daemon`` 和 DHCP 客户端。 停止或应用某卡时先停其监督器，再校验客户端 PID"
" 及接口参数并等待退出， 然后仅清理该卡地址、默认路由和租约；不会根据刚保存的新模式漏停旧客户端。 eth0 保留原有 "
"``/run/reliefos/udhcpc.pid``、``dhcp-lease`` 和 ``dhcp-dns`` "
"路径，其他接口的运行状态带接口名后缀。``network-profile`` 独立于可选 GUI， 关闭 GUI 组件不影响基础网络启动。"
msgstr ""
"At startup, the ``reliefos-dhcp`` OpenRC service enumerates all Ethernet "
"adapters from ``/proc/net/dev``, applying each static/disabled state or "
"starting its own ``supervise-daemon`` and DHCP client. Stopping or applying "
"an interface first stops its supervisor, validates the client PID and "
"interface arguments, waits for exit, and then clears only that interface's "
"addresses, default route, and lease. It does not overlook an old client "
"because the newly saved mode differs. eth0 retains the original "
"``/run/reliefos/udhcpc.pid``, ``dhcp-lease``, and ``dhcp-dns`` paths; other "
"interfaces' runtime state has interface-name suffixes. ``network-profile`` "
"is independent of the optional GUI, so disabling the GUI component does not "
"affect basic network startup."

msgid ""
"DNS 解析器由 ``publish-resolver`` 全系统共享并串行发布。先按内核枚举顺序 "
"收集未禁用且未停止接口的显式自定义/Cloudflare 服务器，再收集 eth0 的自动 RDNSS （仅 eth0 为自动 DNS "
"时），最后按同一顺序收集自动 DHCP 租约；去重后发布最多 三个地址，多余地址保留在各自租约缓存中。某接口的释放、续租或停用不会删除 其他接口的 "
"DNS 状态。单独 eth0 的旧 DNS-only 和固定 DNS 行为保持兼容。"
msgstr ""
"DNS resolver publication is shared system-wide and serialized by ``publish-"
"resolver``. It first collects explicit custom/Cloudflare servers from "
"interfaces that are neither disabled nor stopped, in kernel enumeration "
"order; then eth0's automatic RDNSS, only when eth0 uses automatic DNS; and "
"finally automatic DHCP leases in the same order. After deduplication, at "
"most three addresses are published, with extras retained in their lease "
"caches. Releasing, renewing, or disabling one interface does not delete "
"another's DNS state. Legacy DNS-only and fixed-DNS behavior for eth0 alone "
"remains compatible."

msgid ""
"“仅保存”更改持久化策略，供随后服务重启、DHCP 更新或下次启动读取； “保存并应用”只重新配置选中的接口，可能中断该接口的连接；如果整个服务 "
"已停止，则由 OpenRC 启动服务并配置全部接口。应用失败时已保存的文件 仍保留，程序显示失败和输出，可修正或恢复备份；不能将保存成功等同于联网成功。"
msgstr ""
"Save Only changes persistent policy for later service restarts, DHCP "
"updates, or the next boot. Save and Apply reconfigures only the selected "
"interface and may interrupt its connections; if the entire service is "
"stopped, OpenRC starts it and configures all interfaces. On apply failure, "
"the saved file remains, and the application displays failure and output so "
"you can correct it or restore a backup. Successful saving must not be "
"equated with successful connectivity."

msgid "边界"
msgstr "Boundaries"

msgid ""
"当前 GUI 不提供 IPv6 持久化配置；系统的 IPv6/SLAAC、RDNSS 与命令行配置见 :doc:`ipv6`。此 GUI 也不提供 "
"Wi-Fi、VPN、桥接、VLAN、任意静态路由管理或改变内核固定的 MTU。不能将单条 TCP "
"连接的字节计数冒充网卡总流量。不支持的能力不会显示成已生效。以太网链路能力取决于当前内核和驱动。 QEMU 运行验证与 VMware "
"实机验证分别记录；VMware 验证未完成。"
msgstr ""
"The current GUI provides no persistent IPv6 configuration; for system "
"IPv6/SLAAC, RDNSS, and command-line configuration, see :doc:`ipv6`. It also "
"provides no Wi-Fi, VPN, bridging, VLAN, arbitrary static route management, "
"or changes to the kernel's fixed MTU. Per-connection TCP byte counts must "
"not be passed off as total adapter traffic. Unsupported capabilities are not"
" shown as active. Ethernet link capabilities depend on the current kernel "
"and driver. QEMU runtime and actual VMware verification are recorded "
"separately; VMware verification is incomplete."
